<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<title>butteredfolio</title>
		<style>
			p {
				text-align: center;
				font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
				font-size: 2rem;
			}
			body {
				background-color: #0c0236; /* try #0d0d0d later?? maybe. */
				padding: 16px;
				margin: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
				min-height: 100vh;
				align-items: center;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				justify-content: center;
				color: #fff;
			}
			img {
				width: 256px;
				image-rendering: pixelated;
			}
			a {
				color: #F9B54E;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<img src="toast.png" alt="toast pixel art">
		<p>currently closed for a remake! come back soon for butteredfolio v2 :D</p>
		<p>psst, for now, you can check out my smaller site <a href="https://butteredsaltedtoast.github.io/toaster/">here!</a></p>
	</body>
</html>